th [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]imports it the way `%c` does. One beautiful, undoable loop: path → [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]embed → path.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]image_zoom_origins.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/image_zoom_origins.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-gn[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-gn/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob records attachment origins and ships `bob attachments`[/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]origins[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]origins: add the `.bob/attachments/<host>.jsonl` origin journal, have [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`%c` record every attachment it copies, add `bob attachments import` and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`bob attachments origin`, allowlist the journal in the vault, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]document the contract.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Viewer shows the origin, copies it with `y`, restores it with [bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]`r`[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]viewer[dim] · [dim][/dim]after origins[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]viewer: expose a bob-ledger-tools `attachments` api namespace, then give[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the Z viewer an origin line, key-chip footer, toast pill, and the `y` [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]copy and `r` restore gestures, with tests and docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]`Z` on an image-path bullet imports it[/bold #D7AFFF]                        [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]pathz[dim] · [dim][/dim]after origins, viewer[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]pathz: detect a bullet that holds only an image path, import it through [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bob, rewrite it to bob's embed in one undoable edit, and open the viewer[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]on the new image with an \"Imported\" pill.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-gn","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-gn.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"bob-cli-gn.1"},"source_run_id":"run-013573516afed5a3042605b12a27c9eb","started_at":"2026-11-03T19:56:29.545402+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"0f84d0cfb3bf3d04e3b4cd07b11c955d8b86e11ab04d35d5540628836c59e6e2","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-gn.land/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"8c9d78330c773eea6b465086ab63b85d0cd9d52f563aefdccf5457770b4fefba","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-gn.land/meta.json","size_bytes":692},"prompt":{"digest":"f46b6fedef650f13dd939dbc1ac08a335141d5d17a6bc935f59b02c7a631e815","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-gn.land/prompt.md","size_bytes":238},"state":{"digest":"6e3ed6be517af5d46b5d2cd6653c1a6861727518f3f0236971666eeef73fe974","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-gn.land/state.json","size_bytes":163}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-gn.land","local_name":"bob-cli-gn.land","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-gn","agent_clan_generation":"20261103145536","bead_id":"bob-cli-gn","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-gn","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-astra","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob